flowchart TB
  accTitle: Release and pull deployment
  accDescr: GitHub tests and publishes immutable artifacts, then promotes one site manifest. A separate unprivileged host account pulls desired state, verifies artifacts, applies rootless units and records success after SQL readiness.
  subgraph GitHub["GitHub release pipeline"]
    direction LR
    Source["Application source"] --> CI["Image, SQL and origin tests"]
    CI --> Release["Immutable archives<br/>SHA-256 + Image IDs"]
    Release --> Promotion["Checked promotion"] --> Manifest["Pinned site manifest"]
  end
  subgraph Host["Per-site account on the production host"]
    direction LR
    Pull["Read-only pull<br/>Every 2 minutes"] --> Verify["Verify artifacts"]
    Verify --> Runtime["Rootless Podman<br/>systemd Quadlet"]:::focus
    Runtime --> Ready["SQL-backed HTTPS readiness"] --> Applied["Record applied revision"]:::good
  end
  GitHub -->|Host pulls desired state and release artifacts| Host
  classDef focus fill:#4f46e5,color:#ffffff,stroke:#3730a3,stroke-width:2px
  classDef good fill:#ecfdf5,color:#14532d,stroke:#86b99e
